  "reviewNotes": [
    "t3 covers lodging only for Magome, Tsumago, and Nagiso; the optional Narai/Yabuhara extension day the success criteria calls for has no lodging option identified, so the extension is defined but not actually stayable.",
    "t4 frames rail logistics around reaching the trailhead but never spells out the exit leg from Nagiso onward to Kyoto (e.g., Nagiso → Nagoya/Kiso-Fukushima → Kyoto), leaving the 'connect Tokyo and Kyoto' half of the criteria implicit.",
    "The Narai/Yabuhara extension is defined in t2 but not integrated into the transport plan in t4 — no rail access or placement relative to the two-day route, so adding the extension day would require redoing t4's routing.",
    "No task confirms luggage forwarding (takuhaibin) is actually available at the specific start/end points chosen (Magome, Nagiso, or Narai), which t4 assumes rather than verifies."
